  "instruction": {
    "text": "With your back to the black glass doors, you are going to be, there is going to be a pool to your left and there is going to be a series of columns. If you look through those columns you will see a bush right where those sidewalks intersect. Step towards that bush. Ok. On the otherside of these two plants there is going to be a hot tub. And at the end of the hot tub is a rock. Step right to the right of that rock. Ok. Turn away from the hot tube. You will be looking back toward that covered walkway. Keep the closest column to your left. And see those two windows, two sliding glass windows, it looks like the dividing spot between it. The end point is going to be right in front there, in front of those two windows. ",
